@@@ note
A heading is one logical line at any width — wrapping it would change where the heading ends.

@@@ input
# Title

Body text.

## Subtitle with quite a lot of words in it indeed

@@@ wrap 80
# Title

Body text.

## Subtitle with quite a lot of words in it indeed

@@@ wrap 20
# Title

Body text.

## Subtitle with quite a lot of words in it indeed

@@@ unwrap
# Title

Body text.

## Subtitle with quite a lot of words in it indeed
